  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Lui and leur",
   "texto": [
    "With verbs that carry **à + persona**, replace that person with **lui** (to him or her) or **leur** (to them or to them): **Je parle à Paul** → **Je lui parle**.",
    "Not all verbs with **à** use **lui/leur**: **Je pense à Paul** → **Je pense à lui**. Learn pronoun with verb."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Where are you going?",
   "texto": [
    "Like the COD, **lui** and **leur** pronouns go **delante del verbo**: **Je lui parle**, **Tu leur parles**.",
    "If there is infinitive, they go before him: **Je vais lui écrire** (I will write to him)."
   ]
